<a href="?asd" class="hoo-srchcard-link" data-selection-disabled="true">
    <article class="hoo-srchcard">
        <header class="hoo-srchcard-header">
            <div class="hoo-srchcard-icon">icon</div>
            <h3 class="hoo-srchcard-title">This is just a random title</h3>
            <p class="hoo-srchcard-info">modified by Stefan Bauer by yesterday</p>
        </header>
        <p class="hoo-srchcard-desc">
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Itaque, rem amet. Voluptas exercitationem veniam
            facilis aliquid expedita dolor illo quam. Suscipit tempora adipisci beatae laborum enim corporis numquam.
            Asperiores obcaecati facilis accusamus eum veniam nisi alias sequi impedit dolor quisquam nostrum optio
            molestias minima aut dolorem eveniet, provident debitis hic?
        </p>
        {{> molecules-tag-list-link}}
        <button class="hoo-srchcard-btn" type="button" popovertarget="preview-1">
            <figure class="hoo-srchcard-thumb" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="http://placehold.co/320x180" class="hoo-srchcard-img" alt="This is just a random image">
            </figure>
        </button>
    </article>
    <dialog class="template--listItem--thumbnailContainer hoo-srchcard-popover" data-selection-disabled="true"
        id="preview-1" popover>
        <div class="thumbnail--image">
            <pnp-filepreview>
                <pnp-img alt='preview-image' width="320" height="180" loading="lazy" />
            </pnp-filepreview>
            <div class="thumbnail--hover">
                <div>
                    <pnp-icon data-name="DocumentSearch" aria-hidden="true"></pnp-icon>
                    hello world
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </dialog>

</a>